  "question": {
    "text": "In the circuit shown below, the switch $\\mathrm{S}$ is connected to position $\\mathrm{P}$ for a long time so that the charge on the capacitor becomes $q_{1} \\mu \\mathrm{C}$. Then $\\mathrm{S}$ is switched to position $\\mathrm{Q}$. After a long time, the charge on the capacitor is $q_{2} \\mu \\mathrm{C}$.<br><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/ZHIRLcmz3zRjfLQivbNZ0a4sH8usHPYH0mxhL0TIfqo.original.fullsize.png\"><br>The magnitude of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is _______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1.33",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;is connected to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>,&nbsp;<br />In steady state,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/99af4d0f-7bfb-4f0d-abe1-c832689232ee-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 198px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Now,</p><p>Charge on capacitor,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>&#956;F</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#956;C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.33</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;C</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
